  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "&lt;p&gt;This Telephone Kiosk must be managed in accordance with the agreed “Management Plan NWP Digital Communications Kiosks in Waltham Forest May 2024” and must include the ongoing use of a system to identify repeated anti-social number use, with a review after the first three months of installation between police and New World Payphones to assess any issues arising. Any change to the Management Plan should be approved by the local planning authority and the Metropolitan Police Designing Out Crime Team. The ASB Management Plan must remain for the lifetime of the device.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and supporting documents and thereafter maintained as such for the lifetime of the development: - drawings numbered PY4623-009-001,&amp;nbsp;PY4056/002 24/05/2021,&amp;nbsp;PY4056/005 15/09/2022 - drawings entitled &#x27;Replacement Telephone Kiosk Perspective Views&#x27; , &#x27;Site Location Plan&#x27; - documents entitled &#x27;Specification Document Proposed Public Telephone Kiosk&#x27;, &#x27;Management Plan - NWP Digital Communications Kiosk in Waltham Forest May 2024&#x27;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
